# CrowdStrike
Last Updated: 2026-04-30

> CrowdStrike is a leader in AI-native cybersecurity, delivering the Falcon platform for endpoint security, identity protection, cloud security, threat intelligence, managed detection and response (MDR), and next-generation SIEM. The platform unifies prevention, detection, and response across endpoints, identities, and cloud workloads.

## Platform
- [Falcon Platform](https://www.crowdstrike.com/platform/): Unified AI-native platform powering CrowdStrike’s security capabilities across endpoint, identity, and cloud.

## Core Products

### Protection & Detection
- [Endpoint Security](https://www.crowdstrike.com/platform/endpoint-security/): Endpoint protection and EDR capabilities.
- [Identity Protection](https://www.crowdstrike.com/platform/identity-protection/): Identity threat detection and response.
- [Cloud Security](https://www.crowdstrike.com/platform/cloud-security/): CNAPP, CSPM, CWPP, and cloud runtime protection.

### Operations & Response
- [Next-Gen SIEM](https://www.crowdstrike.com/platform/next-gen-siem/): Cloud-native SIEM, log management, and threat detection.
- [Managed Detection and Response](https://www.crowdstrike.com/services/managed-detection-response/): 24/7 managed threat detection and response services.

### Intelligence
- [Threat Intelligence](https://www.crowdstrike.com/cybersecurity-101/threat-intelligence/): Adversary intelligence, threat research, and insights.

